The problem is that the Macintosh .hqx files did not have a newline at the end.

To fix:

- search for :ENF_OF_FILE
- Insert newline after the colon
- Increment the number of characters for that file (next line) by one
- Repeat for all :END_OF_FILE found.

The shar program used apparently was too stupid to realize that.
